# Local mirror directory for act testing.
#
# When running the release workflow locally with act (see test.sh), build.sh
# downloads the stock eMMC image and the patched binaries from the network.
# To avoid re-downloading on every test, point LOCAL_SOURCE_DIR at a
# directory containing these files; test.sh mounts it read-only into the
# act container and sets DOWNLOAD_BASE_URL to it, so all downloads are served
# from disk.
#
# Required files:
#   emmc.img.xz
#   init
#   su
#   appscmd
#   ostore.zip
#
# If the directory only contains emmc.img (not compressed), copy or
# symlink it as emmc.img.xz, or omit the file and let the build download it.
#
# The mirror is a cache: refresh it whenever one of those releases changes
# (a new OStore version, for example) with
#
#   tools/download-resources.sh "$LOCAL_SOURCE_DIR" --download
#
# which is the same script build.sh uses to fill downloads/ (the URL list lives
# in that script, so a version bump is a single edit).
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and edit the path for your machine.
# .env.local is gitignored so local paths never leak into commits.
LOCAL_SOURCE_DIR=""
